│ patch_description        │ The prior program plateaus at a local optimum via softmin gradient ascent. Following the  │
│                          │ recommendation, I add a two-phase optimizer: (1) a global "move all points" coarse phase  │
│                          │ using random coordinated displacements (σ≈0.01–0.02, re-clipped to the triangle), and (2) │
│                          │ a fine single-point pattern search over 12 directions with shrinking steps. This is       │
│                          │ wrapped in a multi-start loop over several deterministic seeds to escape different local  │
│                          │ basins, always keeping the best configuration found by exact min-triangle-area            │
│                          │ evaluation. All randomness is seeded for determinism, and a fallback feasible             │
│                          │ configuration guards against failures.                                                    │
