│                          │ targeted edits with exact SEARCH text. Edit 1 replaces the chunked `_min_area` with a     │
│                          │ fully vectorized objective (all 165 triplets at once via a precomputed index array), a    │
│                          │ vectorized barycentric clip (the recommended hot-path fix), and helper samplers. Edit 2   │
│                          │ replaces the weak simulated-annealing core (which only moved 8 of 11 points and got stuck │
│                          │ at score 0.18) with a deterministic multi-start greedy hill-climbing scheme with decaying │
│                          │ step sizes that perturbs the vertices of the near-worst triangles, moving any of the 11   │
│                          │ points, plus a final coordinate-descent polish. Multi-start with random barycentric       │
│                          │ restarts is the key improvement for escaping the poor local optimum.                      │
