│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ adam_softmin_optimization_with_binding_constraint_polish                                  │
│ patch_description        │ The current SLSQP-based soft-min optimization is failing (score 0.00), likely because     │
│                          │ SLSQP struggles with the 22-variable bound-constrained problem and the log-sum-exp        │
│                          │ objective's conditioning. I replace it with a robust, fully-vectorized approach grounded  │
│                          │ in the standard technique for the Heilbronn problem: (1) analytic gradients of triangle   │
│                          │ areas in barycentric coordinates via the cross-product chain rule, (2) Adam ascent on a   │
│                          │ soft-min (log-sum-exp) lower bound of the minimum area with annealed sharpness beta,      │
│                          │ projected back onto the simplex u,v >= 0, u+v <= 1 after every step, and (3) a final      │
│                          │ "binding-constraint polish" that takes projected gradient steps using only the            │
│                          │ near-minimal (binding) triangles — exactly the active-set behavior that drives the        │
│                          │ minimum area up at the optimum. Vertices are pinned at the three corners (known to be     │
│                          │ part of good configurations) to guarantee large-scale spread. Deterministic seeds ensure  │
│                          │ reproducibility; the existing try/except fallback is preserved.                           │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
│ api_costs                │ $0.0260                                                                                   │
│ error_attempt            │ None                                                                                      │
│ system_prompt_id         │ None                                                                                      │
│ model_name               │ z-ai/glm-5.3                                                                              │
│ temperature              │ 1.0                                                                                       │
│ max_output_tokens        │ 16384                                                                                     │
│ reasoning                │ {'effort': 'low'}                                                                         │
